            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "swallowed-error (degraded start): the store open failure is only printed and then turned into `None`, and the bound value `_conn` is never used afterwards — the server keeps accepting requests with no storage at all and without ever surfacing that it is broken (health endpoint still answers 200). Fail fast (return/exit on Err) or keep the connection in shared state and report the degraded mode. Related mismatch: a `postgres://...` URL is passed to svc_store::open(), which calls rusqlite Connection::open(path), so it will always fail on this path."
          },
          "ruleId": "swallowed-error"
